{"id":"dito","lemma":"dito","pos":"adj","rank":639,"glosses":["said (mentioned earlier)"],"ipa":"/ˈd͡ʒi.tu/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ec/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-dito.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-dito.wav.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"dita","masculinePlural":"ditos","femininePlural":"ditas"},"examples":[{"text":"Eu não deveria dito aquilo.","en":"I should not have said that.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"should","l":"dever"},null,{"g":"that over there, yon","l":"aquele"}]},{"text":"Eu queria ter dito sim.","en":"I wanted to say yes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/471470","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"querer"},{"g":"to own"},null,{"g":"yes"}]},{"text":"Nem toda verdade deve ser dita.","en":"Not all truths should be spoken.","words":[{"g":"nor"},{"g":"of the Toda people"},{"g":"truth"},{"g":"should","l":"dever"},{"g":"to be"},null]},{"text":"Eu teria dito alguma coisa.","en":"I would've said something.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1270914","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to own","l":"ter"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"something, anything"]]},{"text":"Antes eu não tivesse dito isso.","en":"I wish I hadn't said that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/841078","words":[{"g":"before"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to own","l":"ter"},null,{"g":"that"}]}]}